// A parameter at a session type is spent by its body, as an end a fork binds
// is.
//
// An endpoint left open at the body's end breaks the protocol its type
// states.
//
// The checker refuses it at the placement as `LinearResidue`.
//
// - see: corpus/model/sessions/endpoint-parameter.gandr

/// A parameter at a session type that nothing acts on: the body ends with the
/// endpoint unspent.
@[ refuses("LinearResidue") ]
def leaky(seat : end) -> Unit {
  unit
}
